<title>USA: Heico declares special 10 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Heico declares special 10 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>HEICO Corp on Friday said it declared a special 10 percent stock dividend that will be paid to shareholders in addition to its regular $.05 per share semi-annual cash dividend.</p>
<p>The company will pay both dividends on January 17, 1997 to shareholders of record January 8, 1997, it added.</p>
